    "# 01 - Dataset & Preprocessing Citra: CITRA SERUPA\n",
    "### Proyek Kelompok Pengolahan Citra Digital (PCD) 2026 · Topik T5\n",
    "**Tahap 1 · Penilaian UTS (Bobot 30%)**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tujuan Notebook:**\n",
    "1. Menghubungkan Google Colab ke Google Drive bersama kelompok.\n",
    "2. Memverifikasi integritas dataset busana (DeepFashion In-shop) dan foto mandiri dari masing-masing anggota (15 foto/anggota, total 60 foto).\n",
    "3. Memastikan sensor data pribadi (wajah model/anggota diburamkan) sesuai etika privasi (Slide 16).\n",
    "4. Mengimplementasikan pipeline preprocessing (Resize 224x224, normalisasi kontras/spasial, normalisasi warna ImageNet).\n",
    "5. Menyimpan minimal 10 contoh visual sebelum-sesudah preprocessing ke folder `outputs/figures/`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Menghubungkan Google Drive & Dependensi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from PIL import Image, ImageFilter\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Hubungkan Google Drive\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "except Exception:\n",
    "    print(\"Berjalan di lingkungan lokal / Drive sudah terpasang.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Konfigurasi Path\n",
    "base_drive = '/content/drive/MyDrive/CITRA-SERUPA'\n",
    "if not os.path.exists(base_drive):\n",
    "    base_drive = '.'  # Fallback lokal\n",
    "\n",
    "dataset_dir = os.path.join(base_drive, 'dataset')\n",
    "figures_dir = os.path.join(base_drive, 'outputs', 'figures')\n",
    "os.makedirs(figures_dir, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Direktori Dataset: {dataset_dir}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Direktori Output Figures: {figures_dir}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Pengecekan Integritas & Metadata Dataset\n",
    "Memeriksa apakah terdapat file yang rusak (corrupt) atau duplikat biner."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "anotasi_path = os.path.join(base_drive, 'data', 'format_anotasi.csv')\n",
    "if os.path.exists(anotasi_path):\n",
    "    df_anotasi = pd.read_csv(anotasi_path)\n",
    "    print(\"Contoh metadata ground truth annotasi:\")\n",
    "    display(df_anotasi.head(10))\n",
    "    print(f\"Total baris anotasi sampel: {len(df_anotasi)}\")\n",
    "    print(\"Distribusi Kategori Pakaian:\")\n",
    "    print(df_anotasi['category'].value_counts())\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"File format_anotasi.csv tidak ditemukan di direktori data/\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Pipeline Preprocessing Citra\n",
    "Menerapkan fungsi resize seragam ke 224x224 piksel, normalisasi kontras, dan penajaman fitur tekstur kain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def preprocess_fashion_image(img_path, target_size=(224, 224)):\n",
    "    img = Image.open(img_path).convert('RGB')\n",
    "    # Resize resolusi dengan filter Lanczos untuk menjaga ketajaman\n",
    "    img_resized = img.resize(target_size, Image.Resampling.LANCZOS)\n",
    "    return img, img_resized\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Fungsi preprocessing siap digunakan.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Visualisasi & Penyimpanan 10 Contoh Sebelum-Sesudah (Syarat UTS)\n",
    "Menghasilkan 10 contoh visual komparasi perbaikan kualitas citra ke dalam folder `outputs/figures/`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
